  "claim": "The father of the namesake of the coal-powered Italian transatlantic ocean liner, the SS Principessa Mafalda, was born 11 November 1869.",
  "evidencia": "Page: Princess Mafalda of Savoy. Sentence: Princess Mafalda of Savoy (2 November 1902 – 27 August 1944) was the second daughter of King Victor Emmanuel III of Italy and his wife Elena of Montenegro.\nPage: Victor Emmanuel III of Italy. Sentence: Victor Emmanuel III (Italian: \"Vittorio Emanuele III\" , Albanian: \"Viktor Emanueli III\" ; 11 November 1869 – 28 December 1947) was the King of Italy from 29 July 1900 until his abdication on 9 May 1946.\nPage: SS Principessa Mafalda. Sentence: Named after Princess Mafalda of Savoy, second daughter of King Victor Emmanuel III, the ship entered NGI's South American service between Genoa and Buenos Aires in 1909.",
