        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Principessa Mafalda of Savoy, Victor Emmanuel III\n- Products: SS Principessa Mafalda\n- Topics: Namesakes, birth dates\n\nFacts:\n- Victor Emmanuel III, the father of Principessa Mafalda of Savoy, was born on 11 November 1869.\n- SS Principessa Mafalda was a coal-powered Italian transatlantic ocean liner.\n- SS Principessa Mafalda was named after Principessa Mafalda of Savoy.",
